  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sierra Leone and Liberia Annual Reflection and Adaptation 2025 and 2026 Workshop</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As it was agreed that in 2025, the Annual Review and Adaptation (ARA) process needs to merge with other organisational processes. The objective of this is to create synergies between existing processes, support planning, and reduce the number of organisational requests that go out to core programmes during the year. Since we are bringing all these elements together under one umbrella, the overall process will now be called the Core Programme Strategy Annual Review Process.
The Sierra Leone and Liberia team will focus on the  following during the three days workshop: 
&#x2022;	Hold the Core Programme ARA reflection, and submit the ARA report
&#x2022;	Develop and submit Core Programme MEL Frameworks, or update them if already developed
&#x2022;	Update Core Programme Emergency Preparedness Plans (EPPs) and develop minimum preparedness actions (
&#x2022;	Update Core Programme Risk Registers</narrative>
  </description>
